<title>SPAIN: TABLE-Sevillana H1 profit 11.39 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Sevillana H1 profit 11.39 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six months to end-June for Sevillana de Electricidad group, (in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Attributable profit		  11.39     vs    11.08</p>
<p> Consolidated pretax profit	 15.43     vs    13.83</p>
<p> Turnover (net)			137.76     vs   141.14</p>
<p> Total production value		139.10   vs  142.66</p>
<p> Gross operating result		36.47    vs   39.39</p>
<p> Net operating result		  20.05    vs   24.82</p>
<p> Results from ordinary activities  15.35    vs   15.81</p>
<p> Adjusted value added		  52.62    vs   55.32</p>
</text>
